## const updated = 'July 29, 2026';

<Base
  title="Accessibility | Grayz'n Buffalo"
  description="Accessibility information for the Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill website."
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-content">
      <span class="kicker">Accessibility</span>
      <h1>Accessibility Statement</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

```
  <p>
    Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill is committed to making its website usable
    and accessible to as many people as possible, including people who use
    assistive technologies.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Accessibility Approach</h2>
  <p>
    We work to provide a website that is clear, keyboard-accessible, and
    compatible with modern browsers and assistive technologies. We use the
    Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA as a reference
    when improving the website.
  </p>

  <h2>Accessibility Features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Semantic headings and page structure;</li>
    <li>Keyboard-accessible navigation and controls;</li>
    <li>Visible keyboard focus indicators;</li>
    <li>Text alternatives for meaningful images;</li>
    <li>Links that are identified by more than color alone;</li>
    <li>Responsive layouts that work across screen sizes;</li>
    <li>Support for reduced-motion preferences; and</li>
    <li>Color and contrast choices intended to improve readability.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Ongoing Improvements</h2>
  <p>
    Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We periodically review the website
    and make improvements as content, features, browsers, and assistive
    technologies change.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-Party Content</h2>
  <p>
    Some website features are provided by third parties, including Google
    Maps, Cloudflare Turnstile, and external social-media services. We do
    not control the accessibility of those third-party services, but we
    work to provide accessible alternatives where practical.
  </p>

  <h2>Need Assistance?</h2>
  <p>
    If you have difficulty accessing information on this website or need
    information in another format, contact us. Please describe the page or
    feature involved and the assistance you need so we can respond
    effectively.
  </p>

  <p>
    Call <a href="tel:+17159264431">(715) 926-4431</a> or use our
    <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</div>
